            "id": "7c5f26ba-c6cb-3c33-b8a9-79536811ac6f",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "5 top rare earth stock picks ahead of Trump and Xi meeting",
            "description": "<p>The US and China are expected to reach a deal on Thursday when Presidents Trump and Xi are to meet in South Korea. <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/soybeans-rare-metals-top-talking-174500595.html\">Rare earth minerals</a> are in focus with American rare earth stocks tumbling as US-China tensions ease. William Blair analyst Neal Dingmann shares his top stock picks in the sector.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "The US and China are expected to reach a deal on Thursday when Presidents Trump and Xi are to meet in South Korea. Rare earth minerals are in focus with American rare earth stocks tumbling as US-China tensions ease. William Blair analyst Neal Dingmann shares his top stock picks in the sector. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more&nbsp;Market Catalysts.",
