        {
          "id": "fd56b1f5-3cce-3072-876b-70d4f19aea97",
          "content": {
            "id": "fd56b1f5-3cce-3072-876b-70d4f19aea97",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "What easing US\u2013China tensions mean for rare earth stocks",
            "description": "<p>American rare earth stocks, like American Resources (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AREC\">AREC</a>), USA Rare Earth (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/USAR\">USAR</a>), and United States Antimony (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/UAMY\">UAMY</a>), plunge as US\u2013China tensions ease ahead of President Trump and President Xi's meeting on Thursday in South Korea.</p>\n<p>William Blair analyst Neal Dingmann outlines how to invest in the rare earth space.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
